    "section_custom_code_cream_features": {
      "type": "section-custom-code",
      "name": "Feature tabs",
      "settings": {
        "code": "<style>.cream-tabs{--cream-bg:#0d0326;--cream-text:#ffffff;--cream-text-muted:rgba(255,255,255,.8);--cream-shadow:rgba(255,255,255,.35);--cream-surface:#f5f2ec;--cream-surface-light:#ffffff;--cream-bg-brighter:#26124f;--cream-bg-transparent:rgba(13,3,38,0);--cream-primary:#ab8c52;--cream-primary-text:#fcfbf9;--cream-primary-border:#fcfbf9;--cream-accent:#665035;--cream-border:#d1cdc4;background:var(--cream-bg);color:var(--cream-text);padding:90px 24px}.cream-tabs__inner{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto}.cream-tabs__head{text-align:center;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto 34px}.cream-tabs__head p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--cream-text-muted);}.cream-tabs__head h2{margin:0;line-height:1.18;color:var(--cream-text)}.cream-tabs__set{display:grid;gap:12px}.cream-tabs details{border:1px solid var(--cream-border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--cream-bg);overflow:hidden}.cream-tabs summary{cursor:pointer;padding:20px 68px 20px 24px;list-style:none;position:relative;display:block}.cream-tabs summary .icon-nav-arrow-down{right:24px;color:currentColor}.cream-tabs summary .icon-nav-arrow-down path{stroke:currentColor}.cream-tabs summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.cream-tabs__panel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.85fr) minmax(0,1.15fr);gap:26px;padding:0 24px 24px}.cream-tabs__visual{min-height:260px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--cream-surface),var(--cream-surface-light));display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px;padding:18px}.cream-tabs__visual span{border-radius:8px;background:var(--cream-surface)}.cream-tabs__visual span:first-child{grid-column:span 2;background:var(--cream-primary)}.cream-tabs__body{display:grid;gap:14px;align-content:center}.cream-tabs__body h3{margin:0;color:var(--cream-text)}.cream-tabs__body p{margin:0;line-height:1.85;color:var(--cream-text-muted)}.cream-tabs__body ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.2em;display:grid;gap:7px;color:var(--cream-text-muted)}.cream-tabs [data-collapsible-content]{display:block}@media(max-width:899px){.cream-tabs{padding:64px 16px}.cream-tabs__panel{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:0 16px 18px}.cream-tabs summary{padding:18px 56px 18px 18px}.cream-tabs summary .icon-nav-arrow-down{right:18px}}</style><section class='cream-tabs' id='cream-features'><div class='cream-tabs__inner'><div class='cream-tabs__head'><p class='hero__subheading'>Feature showcase</p><h2>ECサイトの購入体験と運用を支える機能を標準搭載。</h2></div><collapsible-elements class='cream-tabs__set' single='true'><details data-collapsible open='true'><summary data-collapsible-trigger>購入体験{% render 'icon-nav-arrow-down' %}</summary><div class='cream-tabs__body-wrap' style='height: auto;' data-collapsible-body><div class='cream-tabs__content' data-collapsible-content><div class='cream-tabs__panel'><div class='cream-tabs__visual'><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class='cream-tabs__body'><h3>迷わず購入できる導線へ。</h3><p>追従カートやQuick add、予測検索UIを使い、商品を探すところから購入までの流れをスムーズに整えます。</p><ul><li>追従カート</li><li>Quick add</li><li>予測検索UI</li></ul></div></div></div></div></details><details data-collapsible><summary data-collapsible-trigger>商品訴求{% render 'icon-nav-arrow-down' %}</summary><div class='cream-tabs__body-wrap' data-collapsible-body><div class='cream-tabs__content' data-collapsible-content><div class='cream-tabs__panel'><div class='cream-tabs__visual'><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class='cream-tabs__body'><h3>写真だけでは伝わりにくい魅力まで伝える。</h3><p>Shop the look、Before & after、Countdown timerを使い、商品の特徴や利用シーン、お得感を分かりやすく伝えます。</p><ul><li>Shop the look</li><li>Before & after</li><li>Countdown timer</li></ul></div></div></div></div></details><details data-collapsible><summary data-collapsible-trigger>ブランド演出{% render 'icon-nav-arrow-down' %}</summary><div class='cream-tabs__body-wrap' data-collapsible-body><div class='cream-tabs__content' data-collapsible-content><div class='cream-tabs__panel'><div class='cream-tabs__visual'><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class='cream-tabs__body'><h3>ブランドらしさが伝わる第一印象へ。</h3><p>Hero、Slideshow、Video intro、Splash screenを使い、ブランドの世界観やストーリーを印象的に表現できます。</p><ul><li>Hero video</li><li>Slideshow</li><li>Video intro</li></ul></div></div></div></div></details><details data-collapsible><summary data-collapsible-trigger>回遊・検索{% render 'icon-nav-arrow-down' %}</summary><div class='cream-tabs__body-wrap' data-collapsible-body><div class='cream-tabs__content' data-collapsible-content><div class='cream-tabs__panel'><div class='cream-tabs__visual'><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class='cream-tabs__body'><h3>欲しい商品へ迷わずたどり着ける。</h3><p>Mega menu、Collection links、Search popdownを組み合わせ、商品数が増えても探しやすいECサイトを構築できます。</p><ul><li>Mega menu</li><li>Collection links</li><li>Search popdown</li></ul></div></div></div></div></details><details data-collapsible><summary data-collapsible-trigger>信頼・再訪{% render 'icon-nav-arrow-down' %}</summary><div class='cream-tabs__body-wrap' data-collapsible-body><div class='cream-tabs__content' data-collapsible-content><div class='cream-tabs__panel'><div class='cream-tabs__visual'><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class='cream-tabs__body'><h3>購入を迷うユーザーとの接点をつくる。</h3><p>Testimonials、Wishlist、Newsletterを使い、購入前の安心感と、あとから戻って購入できるきっかけを作れます。</p><ul><li>Testimonials</li><li>Wishlist</li><li>Newsletter</li></ul></div></div></div></div></details></collapsible-elements></div></section>",
