    "section_custom_code_cream_usecases": {
      "type": "section-custom-code",
      "name": "Industry use cases",
      "settings": {
        "code": "<style>.cream-usecases{--cream-bg:#0d0326;--cream-text:#ffffff;--cream-text-muted:rgba(255,255,255,.8);--cream-shadow:rgba(255,255,255,.35);--cream-surface:#f5f2ec;--cream-surface-light:#ffffff;--cream-bg-brighter:#26124f;--cream-bg-transparent:rgba(13,3,38,0);--cream-primary:#ab8c52;--cream-primary-text:#fcfbf9;--cream-primary-border:#fcfbf9;--cream-accent:#665035;--cream-border:#d1cdc4;background:var(--cream-bg);color:var(--cream-text);padding:90px 24px}.cream-usecases__inner{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto}.cream-usecases__head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:32px}.cream-usecases__head h2{margin:0;line-height:1.18;color:var(--cream-text)}.cream-usecases__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.cream-usecases__card{aspect-ratio:4/6;border-radius:8px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;background:var(--cream-bg-brighter);color:var(--cream-text);overflow:hidden;position:relative}.cream-usecases__card img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover}.cream-usecases__card::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--cream-bg-transparent),var(--cream-bg));opacity:.78;z-index:1}.cream-usecases__card h3,.cream-usecases__card p{position:relative;z-index:2;margin:0;color:var(--cream-text)}.cream-usecases__card h3{margin-bottom:8px}.cream-usecases__card p{line-height:1.75;color:var(--cream-text-muted)}@media(max-width:999px){.cream-usecases{padding:64px 16px}.cream-usecases__head{display:grid}.cream-usecases__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:599px){.cream-usecases__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cream-usecases__card{grid-column:auto;aspect-ratio:4/6}}</style><section class='cream-usecases'><div class='cream-usecases__inner'><div class='cream-usecases__head'><h2>業種ごとの売り方に、自然にフィットする。</h2></div><div class='cream-usecases__grid'><article class='cream-usecases__card'><img src='https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/6db0ebe78548cf89d011eb0dfb4db96f.png?v=1780990815' alt='アパレルのShop the lookイメージ' loading='lazy'><h3>アパレル</h3><p>Shop the lookで着用イメージから商品詳細へ。</p></article><article class='cream-usecases__card'><img src='https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/72fd8986095864800070d4a14b620617.png?v=1780990814' alt='コスメ・美容のBefore and afterイメージ' loading='lazy'><h3>コスメ・美容</h3><p>Before & afterで変化や使用感をわかりやすく。</p></article><article class='cream-usecases__card'><img src='https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/d314886a4225b31a081ec01c358051b8.png?v=1780990815' alt='食品・D2Cの販促イメージ' loading='lazy'><h3>食品・D2C</h3><p>ストーリー、レビュー、定期的な販促をまとめて表現。</p></article><article class='cream-usecases__card'><img src='https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/3be2d760feaa5d936460a7d2e8807596.png?v=1780990815' alt='実店舗併設のMap導線イメージ' loading='lazy'><h3>実店舗併設</h3><p>Mapや告知導線で来店とECをつなげる。</p></article></div></div></section>",
